LAMMPS (22 Jul 2025)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# Bulk Ni melting via continuous heating, NPT 1 atm
# Mishin et al. 1999 EAM potential

units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p

# FCC Ni: lattice parameter ~3.52 Angstrom
lattice         fcc 3.52
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 3.52 3.52 3.52
region          box block 0 1 0 1 0 1
create_box      1 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (3.52 3.52 3.52)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 4 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (3.52 3.52 3.52)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.000 seconds

# 10x10x10 replication of the unit cell -> 4000 atoms
replicate       10 10 10
Replication is creating a 10x10x10 = 1000 times larger system...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (35.2 35.2 35.2)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  4000 atoms
  replicate CPU = 0.000 seconds

mass            1 58.6934

# Mishin 1999 EAM (setfl format from OpenKIM)
pair_style      eam/alloy
pair_coeff      * * Ni_Mishin_1999.eam.alloy Ni

# Maxwell-Boltzmann initial velocities at 600 K
velocity        all create 600.0 482793 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

timestep        0.001

# Heat from 300 K to 2500 K at 10 K/ps -> 220 ps -> 220000 steps at 1 fs
# NPT: T-damp 0.1 ps, P-damp 1.0 ps, 1 atm = 1.01325 bar (use 1.0 bar in metal units)
fix             1 all npt temp 300.0 2500.0 0.1 iso 1.0 1.0 1.0

thermo          1000
thermo_style    custom step time temp press vol pe ke etotal density

run 10
